      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to take into account the current device state such that we can detect absorption of multiple FED/RED events into one. I think knowing the start state before we allow interrupts is key. And I\u0027d like that to be snapshotted with interrupts disabled (before these interrupts fire which bug 62380 would fix) early in the init sequence.\n\nLet me think about this more. It may be intractable once we lose information on the events. I have a meeting to get to, but I wanted to provide my initial feedback. Please stir on my concern and let me know if you come up with something. I\u0027ll come back to it myself once I have some more free time today.",
      "revId": "0002173e12ba91a44aabe5e6648982edf3a4e781",
